[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様、待って",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina, wait."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありゃ。採取に夢中で汚れちゃってた？\nありがとね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? Did I get dirty while gathering materials? Thank you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん。姉様の世話をするのも、妹の役目だから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not at all. Taking care of you is part of my duty as your sister."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "随分歩いたわね。疲れたでしょう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've walked quite a distance. Are you tired?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシは慣れてるけど……\nそっちはさすがに疲れてきたみたいだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm used to this kind of thing, but... Looks like you're starting to feel it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっとね～。でも素材集めは捗ってるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just a bit... But we're making good progress gathering materials!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様、お水を",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina, here's some water."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。ありがとベップ～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あと、これで汗を拭いて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And use this to wipe your sweat."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップってば気が利く～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're so thoughtful!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ。あなた、さすがに\nベップちゃんになんでも任せっきりじゃないかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina. Don't you think you're relying on Bepp a bit too much for everything?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お母様がたは、みんな同じことをいうわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My mother says the same thing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だってだって。アタシよりベップのほうが\n得意なんだもん。家事とか色々",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But Bepp's just better at these things than me. Like housework and stuff!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あらあら。しっかりした子なのに、\nベップちゃんがいるとすぐ甘えんぼになるんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, my. You're usually so reliable, but the moment she's around, you turn into such a baby."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いやいや甘えんぼって。\nアタシとベップは姉妹！\u3000助け合って生きてる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey now, I'm not being a baby! Bepp and I are sisters! We support each other!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁ……そうね、一理ある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... I suppose you have a point."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシは交渉ごととか考えるのは得意だけど、\nベップは話すのがちょっと苦手！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm good at negotiations and planning, but Bepp's a bit shy when it comes to talking!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップは細かい気配り上手だけど、\nアタシはちょーっと大雑把！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp's great at paying attention to details, but I'm a bit... rough around the edges!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁ……それはそうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... that's true enough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんな風に、アタシたちはお互い得意なことで\n補い合ってるってわけ！\u3000甘えっぱなしじゃないの！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's how we complement each other with our strengths! I'm not just being dependent!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "言われてみれば……そうなのかもしれないわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When you put it that way... maybe you're right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でしょ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "See!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま～た言いくるめられてるよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And there she goes sweet-talking her way out of it again."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]